WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.069
Dr. Syka Brown selected one brand Bouncy Ball
for testing, which came with its cardboard

00:00:06.069 --> 00:00:07.410
label still attached.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:11.080
The ball was placed in the machinery on the
"Fine" setting, and produced a ball with a

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:14.500
label identifying it as an "Extra Bouncy Ball."

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.590
This resulting ball was placed back in the
machine, once again on the "Fine" setting.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:22.860
It produced a smaller ball, in a different
color, with a label calling it a "Super-Duper

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.860
Bouncy Ball."

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.490
This product does not appear to be sold in
stores.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.270
The Super-Duper Bouncy Ball was placed in
914 on the setting "Very Fine".

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:34.350
No changes were made to its appearance, but
when Dr. Brown dropped the ball its resulting

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:38.120
bounce caused forty-five casualties and propelled
it out of the Earth's atmosphere.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.430
Currently, it is orbiting near Mars.

